<title>UK: Wuertemberische Hypo sets 100 mln Dem step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Wuertemberische Hypo sets 100 mln Dem step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **3.75	MATURITY  **28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-UP	ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p> NOTES	**STEPS UP TO 4.25 PCT FROM 28.APR.97 IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		  OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 834</p>
</text>
